# version. The page was waiting to SEE the panel go away before it would believe
# it had come back, and a four-second swap fell between two one-second polls.
# He asked whether the UI was timer-based. It was worse: it inferred a stage from
# a FAILED POLL. Now nothing is marked that was not recorded by someone.
