    # queue first in, first out, so the older reply's "Yes!" is voiced before the
    # newer reply's - the chunk goes to the older; only when the older's is
    # spoken does the next "Yes!" fall to the newer. A control that preferred
    # the newest passed the Mirabelle run, where no such tie exists (p181)
