# ---------------------------------------------------------- v3.76 patch195
# The owner's rule after his self-test proved a held DLL can be neither replaced
# nor renamed away: no updater begins while its own server is starting, running
# or stopping. The llama.cpp updater looks at the llama.cpp slots only, the
