# ---------------------------------------------------------- v3.80 patch47
# Read from audio.cpp's own source: /v1/tasks/run promotes a fixed set of top-level
# fields into a model's option map and reads everything else from an "options"
# object. The panel sent every field flat - HeartMuLa's tags were empty, MiniMax got
# no style. Now the request nests. The bridge takes the style from the lyrics when
# SkyrimNet's prompt is empty and passes its negative tags. The response payload
# strips its ```json fence and both payload panes paint with the terminal's inks.
# The page asks the browser for sound at load, so the yellow bar comes before the
# first thought is lost.
section("v3.80 patch47: the request the model actually reads; the bridge's style and negatives; payload inks; sound asked at load")

