# where SkyrimNet must call; Server > Decision Models offers ggml-org's. The JEV switch, the Jevify
# readout and the JEV converter of patches 56-57 are gone. The llama.cpp update check reads the
# release listing only: /releases/latest skips pre-releases, and every ggml build is one now.
