# ---------------------------------------------------------- v3.91 patch2
# Five clients. Proxy Setup registers up to five other panels; Live Network > Client and the new
# Server > Client show each one's OWN page in a drawer flap - the client's code, drawn from its own
# state, served through this panel's relay into a sandboxed frame. Permissions > Client Settings
# decides what this panel may change on each, and the client decides again: Trust my host names
# the one host it accepts, and a relayed change is held to the Live Network links and the server
# cards' controls, with no value that could run as code in a launcher.
section("v3.91 patch2: five clients; a client's own pages on its host; both sides decide what changes")

