# ------------------------------------------------- v3.76 patch24: the differ is proven
# term-diff.js shipped in patch23 with an absolute require path into the working
# directory of the session that wrote it, no exit code, and no check here - present,
# encoding-checked, and unable to say no (gotcha 193). A presence check cannot catch
# that: the file was there throughout. So the gate EXECUTES it. Self against self
# must report identical and exit 0 on every terminal; a build with one colour moved
# must report DIFFERENT and exit 1 - the control that tells a differ that runs from
# one that always says zero. The corpus here is a fixture ON PURPOSE: what is under
# test is the differ, not a migration - migrations are proven against real session
# logs (gotcha 192), and this section must never be 'improved' by feeding it one.
